      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .faq-section {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 16px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .faq-title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n  .faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n  .faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n  .faq-question {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: #fff;\n    transition: background 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question {\n    background: #f7f7f7;\n  }\n  .faq-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n  }\n  .faq-icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .faq-question-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 17px);\n    color: #2b2fa3;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question-text {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .faq-chevron {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-chevron {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n  .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;\n    padding: 0 16px 0 52px;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 300px;\n    padding-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 500px) {\n    .faq-answer {\n      padding-left: 40px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-list\">\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">How do I get natural, hair-like strokes?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Use the micro-fine tip to draw short, feathery strokes in the direction your brow hair grows, starting from the tail and working toward the front. Layer lightly in sparse areas rather than pressing down hard — the tip is precise enough that a light hand gives the most realistic result.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Is it waterproof and smudge-proof?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. The formula is waterproof, sweat-resistant, and built to hold through a full day — including workouts, humidity, and light rain. It sets quickly after application, so avoid touching the area for a few seconds while it dries.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">How do I pick the right shade?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Match the shade to your natural brow hair, not your skin tone — going one shade lighter than your hair color is usually the safest bet since it's easy to build up but hard to soften strokes that run too dark.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">How do I remove it at the end of the day?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>A gentle oil-based cleanser or micellar water removes it easily. Because the formula is long-wear, a plain water rinse usually isn't quite enough — a swipe with an oil-based remover will lift it without tugging on the skin.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Can beginners use this, or is it just for pros?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>It's beginner-friendly, though it does reward a light touch. Start with a few strokes at the arch and outer tail — the areas most people are sparsest — before filling in the rest, and build up gradually rather than going in heavy on the first pass.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\" data-link=\"https://doctoraltheaglobal.com/account/login\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Manage your subscription</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(q => {\n    q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      const link = this.getAttribute('data-link');\n      if (link) {\n        window.location.href = link;\n        return;\n      }\n      const item = this.parentElement;\n      const wasActive = item.classList.contains('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));\n      if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
